---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/okad-house.css';
---

<Base title="UGC for Skincare Brands — Video Ads That Convert | OKAD" description="UGC video ads built for skincare and beauty brands. Before-and-after demos, unboxing, routine videos. 600+ creators, from $500.">
  <div class="okh">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="khero" style="padding:80px 0 48px">
      <div class="w" style="max-width:900px">
        <span class="kick">UGC for Skincare & Beauty</span>
        <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem);margin-bottom:16px">Skincare UGC That Sells — <span class="cap">Not Just Looks Pretty</span></h1>
        <p class="lead">Skincare buyers don't trust polished studio ads. They trust real people showing real results on real skin. UGC videos featuring everyday creators applying your serum, documenting a 30-day skin journey, or walking through their evening routine consistently outperform brand-produced content in paid campaigns. We build that content for you: scripted, shot by vetted creators, and edited for Meta and TikTok.</p>
        <div class="row" style="margin-top:24px">
          <a class="btn" href="https://calendly.com/okad_calls/first" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a call</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="mailto:olga@okad.agency">Email us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Stats Row -->
    <section style="background:var(--dark,#111);padding:48px 24px">
      <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:24px;text-align:center">
        <div><h3 style="color:var(--green,#aed058);font-size:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);font-weight:600">600+</h3><p style="color:var(--muted,#8e8e8e);font-size:14px">Vetted creators</p></div>
        <div><h3 style="color:var(--green,#aed058);font-size:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);font-weight:600">100+</h3><p style="color:var(--muted,#8e8e8e);font-size:14px">Beauty brands served</p></div>
        <div><h3 style="color:var(--green,#aed058);font-size:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);font-weight:600">5 days</h3><p style="color:var(--muted,#8e8e8e);font-size:14px">Average turnaround</p></div>
        <div><h3 style="color:var(--green,#aed058);font-size:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);font-weight:600">$500</h3><p style="color:var(--muted,#8e8e8e);font-size:14px">10 videos</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why UGC Works for Skincare -->
    <section style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px">
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);margin-bottom:8px">Why UGC Works for Skincare</h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--text,#383838);margin-bottom:24px">Skincare is one of the most trust-dependent consumer categories. Buyers are putting products on their face and need to see proof before committing. Clinical imagery and lab-coat aesthetics used to convert, but today's shoppers scroll right past them. They stop for a real person showing texture, application, and honest reactions.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:16px">
        <div style="background:#f4f9e8;border-radius:16px;padding:24px">
          <h3 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">Authenticity over polish</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text,#383838)">Skincare consumers have developed a sharp filter for overly produced content. A creator filming in their bathroom mirror, showing the actual product on their actual skin, triggers a fundamentally different response than studio footage with perfect lighting. It feels like a recommendation from a friend — and brands that lean into this imperfection consistently see higher engagement and lower CPA.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#f3e5f5;border-radius:16px;padding:24px">
          <h3 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">Visual demonstrations sell</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text,#383838)">Skincare products are inherently visual — texture, consistency, absorption, immediate glow. A 30-second video of a creator applying your moisturizer, showing how it blends without pilling, communicates more than any product description. These micro-moments — the satisfying pump of a serum, the way a cream melts in — are what drive add-to-cart behavior in beauty e-commerce.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#e1f5fe;border-radius:16px;padding:24px">
          <h3 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">Social proof at scale</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text,#383838)">When a potential customer sees multiple real people endorsing your sunscreen or vitamin C serum, it creates a bandwagon effect that brand messaging alone cannot replicate. For skincare specifically, seeing someone with a similar skin type get good results removes the biggest barrier to purchase — fear of breakouts, reactions, and wasted money.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#f6f5f4;border-radius:16px;padding:24px">
          <h3 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">Platform-native content</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text,#383838)">TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts reward content that looks native to the platform. UGC naturally fits the visual language — vertical, casual, personality-driven. When your skincare ad looks like the organic content people already follow, it earns more watch time and better ad performance. On TikTok, #skincareroutine has over 40 billion views, and users expect authentic, unfiltered content.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Content Types -->
    <section style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px">
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);margin-bottom:8px">Skincare UGC Formats We Produce</h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--text,#383838);margin-bottom:24px">Different formats serve different goals in the customer journey. We help you pick the right mix based on your product type, audience, and funnel stage.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:16px">
        <div style="background:#f4f9e8;border-radius:16px;padding:24px">
          <h3 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">Unboxing & First Impressions</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text,#383838)">The creator opens your product on camera for the first time, reacting to packaging, texture, and scent in real time. This captures genuine excitement and works exceptionally well for top-of-funnel awareness because it feels spontaneous and shareable.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#f3e5f5;border-radius:16px;padding:24px">
          <h3 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">Morning / Evening Routine</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text,#383838)">A creator integrates your product into their existing skincare routine, showing exactly when and how they use it. This normalizes your product as part of a daily ritual and answers the practical question every buyer has: "Where does this fit in my routine?" Routine videos average 20-40% longer watch times than standalone demos.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#e1f5fe;border-radius:16px;padding:24px">
          <h3 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">Before & After Documentation</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text,#383838)">The creator documents their skin over days or weeks, showing genuine progress in texture, clarity, or hydration. This is the gold standard for skincare UGC — it provides undeniable visual proof and drives the highest conversion rates of any format. We guide creators on lighting consistency and honest documentation.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#feefdb;border-radius:16px;padding:24px">
          <h3 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">Ingredient Deep-Dives</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text,#383838)">A creator breaks down your key ingredients — explaining what niacinamide does, why hyaluronic acid matters, how retinol should be layered. This targets the educated skincare consumer who reads INCI lists and positions your brand as transparent and science-backed without clinical stiffness.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#f6f5f4;border-radius:16px;padding:24px">
          <h3 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">Get Ready With Me (GRWM)</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text,#383838)">A creator films their full getting-ready process, weaving your product into a broader beauty moment. GRWM is among the most-watched formats on TikTok and Instagram. Your product gets organic screen time within a format people actively seek out and watch to completion.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How We Work -->
    <section style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px">
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);margin-bottom:24px">How We Work</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:16px">
        <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border,#e6e6e6);border-radius:16px;padding:24px">
          <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--green-dark,#92c610);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px">Step 01</span>
          <h3 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin:12px 0 8px">Brief & Strategy</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text,#383838)">We study your product line, target audience, key claims, and competitive landscape. We review your current ad performance and build a content strategy: which formats to lead with, what messaging angles to test, and how to position your product for each platform.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border,#e6e6e6);border-radius:16px;padding:24px">
          <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--green-dark,#92c610);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px">Step 02</span>
          <h3 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin:12px 0 8px">Creator Matching</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text,#383838)">From our 600+ vetted creators, we select those who match your brand's demographic, skin type focus, and aesthetic. If you sell acne solutions for teens, we find creators in that age range. If you're luxury anti-aging, we match accordingly. You approve before production begins.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border,#e6e6e6);border-radius:16px;padding:24px">
          <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--green-dark,#92c610);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px">Step 03</span>
          <h3 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin:12px 0 8px">Production & Variants</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text,#383838)">We produce 3-5 hook variants per concept because the first three seconds determine everything. Each video gets multiple CTA approaches. All content is shot in platform-native formats (9:16, 1:1, 16:9) and edited with captions, pacing, and music optimized for each placement.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border,#e6e6e6);border-radius:16px;padding:24px">
          <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--green-dark,#92c610);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px">Step 04</span>
          <h3 style="font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin:12px 0 8px">Delivery & Iteration</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text,#383838)">You receive raw footage and professionally edited versions organized by concept. Each delivery includes performance notes: which hooks we expect to perform best, suggested testing order, and targeting recommendations. After your first round runs, we review data together and iterate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <style>
      .faq details{border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6}
      .faq details:first-child{border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6}
      .faq summary{padding:20px 0;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;font-weight:500;font-size:16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
      .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
      .faq summary::after{content:"+";font-size:20px;color:#8e8e8e}
      .faq details[open] summary::after{content:"\2212"}
      .faq .ans{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;max-width:680px}
    </style>
    <section style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px">
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);margin-bottom:24px">FAQ</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <details>
          <summary>How much does skincare UGC cost?</summary>
          <div class="ans">Our skincare UGC packages start at $500 for a batch of 10 videos. That includes creator sourcing, scripting, production management, and professional editing. Pricing scales based on the number of videos, creator tier, and whether you need extended usage rights. Most skincare brands start with a test batch and scale up once they see ad performance data.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How long does production take?</summary>
          <div class="ans">Standard turnaround is 5 business days from brief approval to final delivery. That includes creator matching, product shipping (if needed), filming, and editing. Before-and-after content takes longer — typically 3-4 weeks — because creators need real time with the product to document genuine results. Rush delivery is available for an additional fee.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How do you select creators for skincare brands?</summary>
          <div class="ans">We match creators based on your target demographic, skin type focus, brand aesthetic, and campaign goals. If you sell products for acne-prone skin, we select creators who visibly have those concerns — not models with flawless complexions. Every creator is vetted for video quality, delivery style, reliability, and content authenticity. You approve the final selection before production begins.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Who owns the content?</summary>
          <div class="ans">You receive full commercial usage rights for all content produced. You can run the videos as paid ads, post them organically, use them on your website, include them in email campaigns, and repurpose them across any channel. Standard usage rights are included for 12 months, with extended or perpetual licensing available.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What about FDA and FTC compliance?</summary>
          <div class="ans">We build compliance into every brief. Creators cannot make drug claims — only cosmetic claims are permissible for non-drug products. Before-and-after content must be genuine and not enhanced with filters. All paid partnerships include clear disclosure per FTC guidelines. We handle the guardrails so your brand stays protected while content stays authentic.</div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section style="background:var(--dark,#111);padding:80px 24px;text-align:center">
      <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto">
        <h2 style="color:#fff;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.2rem);margin-bottom:16px">Ready to Scale Your Skincare Brand with UGC?</h2>
        <p style="color:#8e8e8e;margin-bottom:32px">Book a free strategy call. We'll review your current ads, audit your creative, and map out a UGC plan built around your hero products.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <a class="btn" href="https://calendly.com/okad_calls/first" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a free strategy call</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="mailto:olga@okad.agency">Email olga@okad.agency</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

