        {"@type": "Question", "name": "How long does production take?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Standard turnaround is 5 business days from brief approval to final delivery. That includes creator matching, product shipping (if needed), filming, and editing. Before-and-after content takes longer — typically 3-4 weeks — because creators need real time with the product to document genuine results. Rush delivery is available for an additional fee."}},
        {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do you select creators for skincare brands?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We match creators based on your target demographic, skin type focus, brand aesthetic, and campaign goals. If you sell products for acne-prone skin, we select creators who visibly have those concerns — not models with flawless complexions. Every creator is vetted for video quality, delivery style, reliability, and content authenticity. You approve the final selection before production begins."}},
        {"@type": "Question", "name": "Who owns the content?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "You receive full commercial usage rights for all content produced. You can run the videos as paid ads, post them organically, use them on your website, include them in email campaigns, and repurpose them across any channel. Standard usage rights are included for 12 months, with extended or perpetual licensing available."}},
        {"@type": "Question", "name": "What about FDA and FTC compliance?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We build compliance into every brief. Creators cannot make drug claims — only cosmetic claims are permissible for non-drug products. Before-and-after content must be genuine and not enhanced with filters. All paid partnerships include clear disclosure per FTC guidelines. We handle the guardrails so your brand stays protected while content stays authentic."}}
      ]
    }
    </script>

  </div>
</Base>
